  "description": "ADO-VIEW Filter grammar on a client static read-only Recordset of SELECT ID, L, S FROM T ORDER BY ID: twenty criteria strings (comparison operators, AND, OR, NOT, parentheses, LIKE with '%', '*' and no wildcard, IN, BETWEEN, a malformed AND OR, '==' and '!=', a differently cased string value, a bracketed and a table-qualified field name, a function call and an arithmetic expression); for each assign Filter, read it back, RecordCount and the matching IDs, then Filter none. Asks which constructs the filter grammar accepts and which rows each selects.",
